                  <p xml:id="idm32">Duetter (Characteerstykker. Suite) / for / Claveer og Violin / I:P:E: Hartmann</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_e181b3d0">38 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_74bf8a3b">35 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_08aa0356">Written in brown ink. Paper: 14 staves. Sporadic pagination. The first 18 pages contains a fair copy of the introduction and four movements named "I", "III." (corrected to II) above which Hartmann has written "Skrives ikke", "V" (corrected to "IV") and "Slutning" (End). This has been cancelled, where after Hartmann has added "Fine" in pencil after No. IV, which is end-dated "23/7 64". Then follows a fair copy of the second movement of the printed edition dated "17/8 64.", and a fair copy of the third movement of the printed edition dated "26/8 64." The last 8 pages contains the fifth movement of the printed edition, above which Hartmann originally has written "Fantasistykke N<rend xml:id="idm36" rend="sup">o</rend> 5, but corrected to "IV".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
